{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "REV.22.ASW"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/REV/22-c537a43cb86d556259b379a4ff3fec16.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/REV/22-c537a43cb86d556259b379a4ff3fec16.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}, {"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1668/32k/REV/22-5f33c0ec951e8c143784dfd25ceb94b5.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1668/m4a/32k/REV/22-5f33c0ec951e8c143784dfd25ceb94b5.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1668, "version_id": 59, "title": "Living Water Bible - ESV Music Project by Lutheran Bible Translators", "timing_available": false, "dramatized": true, "default": false}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bkREV\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch22\" data-usfm=\"REV.22\">\n            <div class=\"label\">22</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">The River of Life</span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">Then the angel</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">22:1 </span><span class=\"ft\">Greek </span><span class=\"fq\">he</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> showed me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezek. 47:1; Zech. 14:8; [Ps. 46:4] </span></span><span class=\"content\">the river of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">the water of life, bright as crystal, flowing from the throne of God and of the Lamb </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">through the middle of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:21 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the street of the city; </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezek. 47:12 </span></span><span class=\"content\">also, on either side of the river, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 14, 19; ch. 2:7; Gen. 2:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the tree of life</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">22:2 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">the Lamb. In the midst of the street of the city, and on either side of the river, was the tree of life</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> with its twelve kinds of fruit, yielding its fruit each month. The leaves of the tree were </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 21:24]</span></span><span class=\"content\">for the healing of the nations. </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Zech. 14:11; [Gen. 3:17] </span></span><span class=\"content\">No longer will there be anything accursed, but </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:3, 23; Ezek. 48:35 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the throne of God and of the Lamb will be in it, and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 7:15</span></span><span class=\"content\">his servants will worship him. </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Matt. 5:8; 1 Cor. 13:12; 1 John 3:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">They will see his face, and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:12; 7:3; 14:1</span></span><span class=\"content\">his name will be on their foreheads. </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">And </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:25 </span></span><span class=\"content\">night will be no more. They will need no light of lamp </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:23 </span></span><span class=\"content\">or sun, for </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 36:9; See ch. 21:11 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the Lord God will be their light, and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Dan. 7:18, 27; Rom. 5:17; 2 Tim. 2:12; See ch. 20:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">they will reign forever and ever.</span></span></div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Jesus Is Coming</span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">And he said to me, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:5 </span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;These words are trustworthy and true. And the Lord, the God of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Cor. 14:32 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the spirits of the prophets, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 1:1</span></span><span class=\"content\">has sent his angel to show his servants what must soon take place.&#8221;</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">&#8220;And behold, </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ver. 12, 20; ch. 3:11   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">I am coming soon. </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 1:3  </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">Blessed is the one who keeps the words of the prophecy of this book.&#8221;</span></span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">I, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 1:1, 4, 9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">John, am the one who heard and saw these things. And when I heard and saw them, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 19:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">I fell down to worship at the feet of the angel who showed them to me, </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[See ver. 8 above] </span></span><span class=\"content\">but he said to me, &#8220;You must not do that! I am a fellow servant with you and your brothers the prophets, and with those </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[See ver. 6 above]</span></span><span class=\"content\">who keep the words of this book. Worship God.&#8221;</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">And he said to me, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 10:4]</span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;Do not seal up the words of the prophecy of this book, for the time is near. </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezek. 3:27; [Dan. 12:10; 2 Tim. 3:13]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Let the evildoer still do evil, and the filthy still be filthy, and the righteous still do right, and the holy still be holy.&#8221;</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">&#8220;Behold, </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ver. 7, 20   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">I am coming soon, </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Isa. 40:10; 62:11   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">bringing my recompense with me, </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Matt. 16:27  </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">to repay each one for what he has done.</span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 1:8 </span></span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">I am the Alpha and the Omega, </span></span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 1:17 </span></span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">the first and the last, </span></span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:6</span></span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">the beginning and the end.&#8221;</span></span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">Blessed are those who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 7:14 </span></span><span class=\"content\">wash their robes,</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">22:14 </span><span class=\"ft\">Some manuscripts </span><span class=\"fq\">do his commandments</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> so that they may have the right to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 2, 19 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the tree of life and that </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 118:20; See ch. 21:27</span></span><span class=\"content\">they may enter the city by the gates. </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Gal. 5:19-21]; See Matt. 8:12 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Outside are </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Phil. 3:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the dogs </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:8</span></span><span class=\"content\">and sorcerers and the sexually immoral and murderers and idolaters, and everyone who loves and practices falsehood.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.15\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 1:1   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">&#8220;I, Jesus, have sent my angel to testify to you about these things </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 1:4   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">for the churches. I am </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See ch. 5:5   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">the root and </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Matt. 1:1   </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">the descendant of David, </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 2:28; Num. 24:17; Isa. 60:3; Matt. 2:2]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">the bright morning star.&#8221;</span></span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.16\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">The Spirit and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:2, 9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the Bride say, &#8220;Come.&#8221; And let the one who hears say, &#8220;Come.&#8221; And </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:6; Isa. 55:1; John 7:37 </span></span><span class=\"content\">let the one who is thirsty come; let the one who desires take the </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">water of life without price.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.17\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">I warn everyone who hears the words of the prophecy of this book: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 4:2; 12:32; [Prov. 30:6]</span></span><span class=\"content\">if anyone adds to them, God will add to him the plagues described in this book, </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">and if anyone takes away from the words of the book of this prophecy, God will take away his share in </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 2, 14 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the tree of life and in </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 21:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">the holy city, which are described in this book.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.19\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">He who testifies to these things says, </span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">&#8220;Surely </span></span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 7, 12 </span></span><span class=\"wj\"><span class=\"content\">I am coming soon.&#8221;</span></span><span class=\"content\"> Amen. </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Tim. 4:8]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Come, Lord Jesus!</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.20\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"REV.22.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">The grace of the Lord Jesus be with all.</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">22:21 </span><span class=\"ft\">Some manuscripts </span><span class=\"fq\">all the saints</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> Amen.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": null, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["REV.21"], "human": "Revelation 21", "toc": true, "